Source: fence
Section: misc
Maintainer: Local Builder <builder@localhost>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), curl
Homepage: https://github.com/Use-Tusk/fence

Package: fence
Architecture: amd64
Description: Lightweight sandbox for running commands with network and filesystem restrictions.
 Fence wraps commands in a sandbox that blocks network access by default
 and restricts filesystem operations based on configurable rules. It's most
 useful for running semi-trusted code with controlled side effects.
